{"text": "I often use food delivery services. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> But today I did not. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Instead I walked to my favorite restaurant. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> With a reusable container. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> And picked up the food. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I heard that plastic never goes away completely. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I did not use any single use plastic today. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I felt good. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Yesterday I took some plastic and glass bottles. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To a recycling machine near my house. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I put them into the machine. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One by one and I got some points. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> In return. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> What can I do with those points. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Well I can use them. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Like money. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Do you not think that is cool.", "alignment": {"characters": ["I", " ", "o", "f", "t", "e", "n", " ", "u", "s", "e", " ", "f", "o", "o", "d", " ", "d", "e", "l", "i", "v", "e", "r", "y", " ", "s", "e", "r", "v", "i", "c", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "B", "u", "t", " ", "t", "o", "d", "a", "y", " ", "I", " ", "d", "i", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", "n", "s", "t", "e", "a", "d", " ", "I", " ", "w", "a", "l", "k", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "m", "y", " ", "f", "a", "v", "o", "r", "i", "t", "e", " ", "r", "e", "s", "t", "a", "u", "r", "a", "n", "t", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "W", "i", "t", "h", " ", "a", " ", "r", "e", "u", "s", "a", "b", "l", "e", " ", "c", "o", "n", "t", "a", "i", "n", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s